        "TileImage": "$($repository cee4e428-1efb-42ef-8eb5-763822781738).Image",
        "Description": "47,\rSome bad news, your last contract was a phony. The money transfered to the ICA, disappeared hours ago. It took alot of digging but we tracked the client down. None other than Jason Portman. He&apos;s currently enjoying a stay at Haven, trying to dissapear off the face of the Earth, a good plan. We also found that Aruna Narain, the hacker Jason used to steal the funds back, is staying with him. Eliminate them both make sure no one knows where to look for their killers.\rI shall leave you to prepare",
